# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The AUC measures how well a model ranks good above bad credits, independent of a decision threshold, which makes it the most informative metric on this imbalanced dataset (70% good credits). In Kipu Quantum's benchmarks, the quantum-transformed features on their own reached an AUC similar to the classical baseline, and the hybrid model, which combines both, reached the highest AUC and F1 score. The quantum-transformed features therefore add information that the classical features do not provide on their own.\n"
msgstr "AUC mengukur seberapa baik model meranking kredit baik di atas kredit buruk, terlepas dari ambang keputusan, sehingga menjadi metrik paling informatif pada dataset yang tidak seimbang ini (70% kredit baik). Dalam benchmark Kipu Quantum, fitur hasil transformasi kuantum saja mencapai AUC yang mirip dengan baseline klasik, dan model hibrida, yang menggabungkan keduanya, mencapai AUC dan skor F1 tertinggi. Jadi, fitur hasil transformasi kuantum menambahkan informasi yang tidak disediakan oleh fitur klasik saja.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Clean up (optional) {#clean-up-optional}"
msgstr "Bersih-bersih (opsional) {#clean-up-optional}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "A fitted mapping stays available until you delete it. If you do not want to map further data with it, delete it. A deletion does no quantum work, uses no QPU time, and cannot be undone.\n"
msgstr "Pemetaan yang sudah di-fit tetap tersedia sampai kamu menghapusnya. Kalau kamu tidak ingin memetakan data lain dengannya, hapus saja. Penghapusan tidak melakukan kerja kuantum, tidak memakai waktu QPU, dan tidak bisa dibatalkan.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Conclusion {#conclusion}"
msgstr "Kesimpulan {#conclusion}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "What you accomplished {#what-you-accomplished}"
msgstr "Yang sudah kamu capai {#what-you-accomplished}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this tutorial, you accomplished the following:\n"
msgstr "Di tutorial ini, kamu telah melakukan hal-hal berikut:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepared a real-world credit risk dataset with categorical and numerical attributes for quantum feature extraction.\n"
msgstr "Menyiapkan dataset risiko kredit dunia nyata dengan atribut kategorikal dan numerik untuk ekstraksi fitur kuantum.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Established a classical random forest baseline.\n"
msgstr "Membuat baseline random forest klasik.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '3. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Used Rimay to fit a quantum feature mapping on quantum hardware and map the training and test sets in one run.\n"
msgstr "Memakai Rimay untuk mem-fit pemetaan fitur kuantum pada hardware kuantum dan memetakan set pelatihan dan uji dalam satu run.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '4. '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Trained the same model on quantum-transformed and on combined features, and compared them with the baseline.\n"
msgstr "Melatih model yang sama pada fitur hasil transformasi kuantum dan pada fitur gabungan, lalu membandingkannya dengan baseline.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Title ###
#, no-wrap
msgid "Key takeaways {#key-takeaways}"
msgstr "Poin penting {#key-takeaways}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Rimay fits into an existing machine learning pipeline as one additional preprocessing step. You keep your data preparation and your classical model.\n"
msgstr "Rimay masuk ke pipeline machine learning yang sudah ada sebagai satu langkah prapemrosesan tambahan. Persiapan datamu dan model klasikmu tetap dipakai.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "The number of qubits bounds the number of input features, and the number of rows times `shots` bounds the size of a single job.\n"
msgstr "Jumlah qubit membatasi jumlah fitur input, dan jumlah baris dikali `shots` membatasi ukuran satu job.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-12
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Use the quantum-transformed features combined with the original features as a default, because the model can use both.\n"
msgstr "Pakai fitur hasil transformasi kuantum yang digabung dengan fitur asli sebagai default, karena model bisa memanfaatkan keduanya.\n"

